@PhotoWorld.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7041

### Exchange a provider access token for a PhotoWorld JWT (registers the user on first call)
POST {{PhotoWorld.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/external
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "Google",
  "accessToken": "<google-access-token>"
}

### Current user (paste the accessToken returned above)
GET {{PhotoWorld.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer <photoworld-jwt>
